 "best_diff": "--- initial\n+++ best\n@@ -21,15 +21,24 @@\n \n     Current method: next fit (open a new bin whenever the next item does not fit).\n     \"\"\"\n+    # Create (size, index) pairs and sort by size descending (FFD)\n+    indexed_sizes = sorted([(sizes[i], i) for i in range(len(sizes))], key=lambda x: x[0], reverse=True)\n+    \n     bins = []\n-    current, load = [], 0\n-    for i, s in enumerate(sizes):\n-        if load + s > capacity:\n-            bins.append(current)\n-            current, load = [], 0\n-        current.append(i)\n-        load += s\n-    if current:\n-        bins.append(current)\n+    \n+    for size, index in indexed_sizes:\n+        placed = False\n+        # Try to fit into existing bins (First Fit)\n+        for bin_contents in bins:\n+            current_load = sum(sizes[i] for i in bin_contents)\n+            if current_load + size <= capacity:\n+                bin_contents.append(index)\n+                placed = True\n+                break\n+        \n+        # If it didn't fit anywhere, start a new bin\n+        if not placed:\n+            bins.append([index])\n+            \n     return bins\n # OMEGA-BLOCK-END\n",
